Input and navigation follow MicroDAP at cb78c74:

- player/src/core/PadSource.h and DbusPad.cpp: direction repeat timing and the fallback to a still held direction.
- player/qml/MicroDap/screens/Home.qml: home menu keys, back opening the recent grid, no pane change on a repeat.
- player/qml/MicroDap/screens/Quickplay.qml: moveVertical, a move onto a partial last row lands on its last tile.
- player/qml/MicroDap/screens/Quickplay.qml: the grid row scroll, 100 ms easeIn that retargets on every row step.

Page and menu motion reuse:

- MicroDAP cb78c74, player/qml/MicroDap PageStack.qml, Turnstile.qml and screens/Home.qml: menu exit and entrance,
  page push and back timings.
- funeOS d58193469, bezier in player/core/curves.cpp: the cubic bezier form used by the width slide.
- funeOS 35ec2a60a, CanvasT::coverage_turn in player/gfx/canvas.cpp: counter clockwise text, here each line turned
  once into a coverage plane and drawn with Canvas::coverage.
- MicroDAP cb78c74, player/qml/MicroDap/screens/NowPlaying.qml trackChanged and trackAnim: the title change motion
  and its coalescing.
- funeOS c319d2ef2, docs/DESIGN.md input during motion: a back reverses a running push or expand from where it is,
  every leg running back over the time it has run.

Cover tiles:

- funeOS d58193469, taps and bilinear in player/gfx/canvas.cpp: the tile size cover scale in blockie/image.cpp.

